WEBVTT

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:44.820
I'll be back next week at the same time.

00:01:45.260 --> 00:01:47.280
Here we go!

00:01:47.280 --> 00:01:49.030
Let's party!

00:01:49.230 --> 00:01:51.240
Okay!

00:01:51.480 --> 00:01:55.660
Ooh! It's been so long, Kyoshiro-sama!

00:01:55.890 --> 00:01:58.920
H-Help...

00:01:58.920 --> 00:02:01.900
And the Madame is about to come!

00:02:01.900 --> 00:02:03.090
We haven't even started,

00:02:03.090 --> 00:02:06.880
and Kyoshiro-san has already been 
hunted down by the monsters!

00:02:06.890 --> 00:02:09.260
Help!

00:02:07.280 --> 00:02:12.870
<b>Girls Like Vegeta, Guys Like Piccolo</b>

00:02:12.920 --> 00:02:15.690
Kyoshiro-san has been hunted 
down by the monsters!

00:02:15.690 --> 00:02:17.140
Why did this have to happen now?

00:02:17.140 --> 00:02:18.390
Don't worry.

00:02:18.390 --> 00:02:20.180
He's the number one host.

00:02:20.180 --> 00:02:22.650
He can handle that lot with 
one arm behind his back.

00:02:23.100 --> 00:02:25.150
Look. It's the "I'll be back" hand.

00:02:25.510 --> 00:02:29.070
Uh, as far as we know, that hand 
is the only thing left of him!

00:02:29.370 --> 00:02:30.790
We need to get him out of there

00:02:30.790 --> 00:02:33.080
and ask the monsters to go back to their den!

00:02:33.250 --> 00:02:36.930
Damn. Unfortunately we're only the help for the help.

00:02:36.930 --> 00:02:38.580
TOSHI, are you ready?

00:02:38.580 --> 00:02:40.100
Don't give me that crap!

00:02:40.100 --> 00:02:43.570
How are we supposed to "Let's 
party!" with those piranhas!

00:02:43.570 --> 00:02:46.090
Then we'll have to save him together!

00:02:46.470 --> 00:02:47.600
Screw that!

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:48.900
All the money in the world wouldn't

00:02:48.900 --> 00:02:50.660
be enough to get me to deal with them!

00:02:50.660 --> 00:02:51.590
Son of a bitch!

00:02:53.010 --> 00:02:55.680
Wait, I just dropped by to visit.

00:02:55.680 --> 00:02:57.420
Where do you think you're going?

00:02:57.420 --> 00:02:58.780
GIN-sama?

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:02.810
The night is still young!

00:03:03.780 --> 00:03:07.670
Bring me more booze, you stinkin' host!

00:03:09.710 --> 00:03:12.780
Th-The monster of Yoshiwara is here!

00:03:12.780 --> 00:03:14.830
B-Boss, you're drinking too much!

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:18.600
Shut up! I said to relax today!

00:03:18.600 --> 00:03:20.480
Don't call me Boss. It's Tsu-ki.

00:03:20.610 --> 00:03:21.940
Welcome.

00:03:21.940 --> 00:03:26.000
Yeah, you wanted a crowd, so I 
brought everyone I could find.

00:03:26.270 --> 00:03:28.860
We really get to drink all we want?

00:03:28.860 --> 00:03:31.620
Yes, normally you have to serve men,

00:03:31.620 --> 00:03:33.250
but this is like a Yoshiwara for women.

00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:34.770
Time for some payback.

00:03:34.760 --> 00:03:36.910
Again, nobody gave you 
permission to do this, Sis!

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:37.640
Okay. Let's do this, girls.

00:03:36.910 --> 00:03:39.520
And why is Tsukuyo-san already drunk?

00:03:39.590 --> 00:03:41.590
I-I'm sorry. Boss...

00:03:41.590 --> 00:03:43.400
Tsu-ki has never been to a host club

00:03:43.400 --> 00:03:45.400
before so she's a little nervous.

00:03:45.550 --> 00:03:47.180
Hey, bring some girls!

00:03:47.180 --> 00:03:48.080
And music!

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:50.480
Play "Beer Tears Man Woman!"

00:03:50.640 --> 00:03:52.170
In what way is she nervous?!

00:03:52.170 --> 00:03:54.740
She sounds like a regular customer!

00:03:55.020 --> 00:03:56.610
G-Got it.

00:03:56.610 --> 00:03:58.730
I'll go find you some girls...

00:03:58.730 --> 00:04:01.250
Hey! He's trying to run away again!

00:04:07.040 --> 00:04:08.960
Oh, a girl.

00:04:15.070 --> 00:04:17.380
Kyu-Kyubei-san's here too?!

00:04:17.380 --> 00:04:20.010
Oh, Kyu-chan. You came.

00:04:20.740 --> 00:04:21.850
Sorry about being late.

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:25.850
You said that I could only bring girls,

00:04:27.140 --> 00:04:28.290
so it took a while to get ready.

00:04:28.290 --> 00:04:30.860
Why are the Yagyu retainers 
dressed like women?!

00:04:31.230 --> 00:04:34.150
Oh, gosh. If it isn't Tsu-ki?

00:04:34.150 --> 00:04:35.700
Just finish a long day in Yoshiwara?

00:04:35.700 --> 00:04:36.840
Same here.

00:04:36.840 --> 00:04:39.620
And this guy's on his own level of wrong!

00:04:39.870 --> 00:04:43.020
Hey! I never asked for any ugly girls!

00:04:43.020 --> 00:04:44.800
What? That's so mean, Tsu-ki!

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:47.120
We both work in the same line of business.

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:48.270
Uh, excuse me!

00:04:48.740 --> 00:04:52.690
This isn't like Yoshiwara, 
so we don't provide girls...

00:04:52.690 --> 00:04:55.310
What? I heard that this 
is a Yoshiwara for women.

00:04:55.310 --> 00:04:56.800
Well, that's not entirely accurate.

00:04:56.800 --> 00:04:58.140
What's that then?

00:04:58.160 --> 00:04:59.410
<b>Master Roshi Bondage</b>

00:04:58.590 --> 00:05:00.550
The B Course is horse riding.

00:04:59.410 --> 00:05:00.870
<b>Trojan Horse Riding</b>

00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:02.140
The C Course involves candles.

00:05:00.870 --> 00:05:02.120
<b>Candle Wax Play</b>

00:05:02.140 --> 00:05:04.800
And the D Course involves neglect.

00:05:04.800 --> 00:05:07.340
Which should I choose?

00:05:08.360 --> 00:05:09.720
But I can't see.

00:05:09.720 --> 00:05:11.790
And isn't GIN-sama here yet?!

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:13.590
I'm always after the G Course!

00:05:13.590 --> 00:05:16.240
Ma'am, I'm going to pin 
your nose back with hooks

00:05:16.240 --> 00:05:18.030
and stick photos of it all over town.

00:05:18.030 --> 00:05:21.080
You know your stuff. What's your name?

00:05:21.160 --> 00:05:22.950
Sick and twisted!

00:05:23.320 --> 00:05:25.570
Oh! That sounds like something 
GIN-sama would say!

00:05:25.570 --> 00:05:27.110
I've been waiting for you!

00:05:27.110 --> 00:05:29.540
Hey, toss them out with the trash.

00:05:29.540 --> 00:05:31.110
This is such an excellent bar!

00:05:31.110 --> 00:05:32.460
I'm very impressed!

00:05:32.630 --> 00:05:34.470
Hey! Where's my order?!

00:05:34.700 --> 00:05:36.470
Hello? Over here!

00:05:37.140 --> 00:05:39.260
We'll never be able to handle all 
of these customers, Hijikata-san!

00:05:39.260 --> 00:05:41.470
More idiots keep showing up!

00:05:41.660 --> 00:05:42.860
Hey, this is looking bad!

00:05:42.860 --> 00:05:44.140
The place is practically full!

00:05:44.140 --> 00:05:45.730
We're in over our heads!

00:05:46.120 --> 00:05:48.740
And now the trannies are starting a fight!

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:50.520
Eh? Who's your doctor?

00:05:50.520 --> 00:05:52.390
What? It's Takasu, fool.

00:05:52.390 --> 00:05:56.060
Bastard, my senpai gets his from Takasu, too!

00:05:56.060 --> 00:05:58.700
They sound like a couple of addicts 
bragging about their source!

00:05:58.700 --> 00:05:59.300
This is not good!

00:05:59.300 --> 00:06:00.740
We need to stop them!

00:06:00.740 --> 00:06:02.170
What are you doing?!

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:03.550
Help us clear out some customers!

00:06:03.550 --> 00:06:05.620
Shut up! That's what we're doing!

00:06:07.090 --> 00:06:08.920
Sorry about the wait!

00:06:11.150 --> 00:06:13.420
This is our special, Fish on Host!

00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:20.930
They made it worse!

00:06:20.930 --> 00:06:23.140
Stop them! Do something!

00:06:23.140 --> 00:06:24.560
Do what?!

00:06:24.560 --> 00:06:25.560
I know! Kyoshiro-san!

00:06:26.480 --> 00:06:28.560
Kyoshiro-san!

00:06:29.100 --> 00:06:30.280
It's over!

00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:32.620
Forget about the Madame!

00:06:32.620 --> 00:06:34.570
Damn it! What do we do...

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:36.650
Quiet down!

00:06:40.470 --> 00:06:43.950
Don't you understand that you're 
making trouble for the bar?

00:06:43.950 --> 00:06:46.790
You're supposed to control 
yourself when you have fun.

00:06:47.160 --> 00:06:48.500
I've had enough.

00:06:48.810 --> 00:06:50.290
The party is over.

00:06:50.550 --> 00:06:52.540
I apologize for the trouble we caused.

00:06:57.080 --> 00:06:59.120
They instantly put an end to the riot.

00:06:59.120 --> 00:07:00.420
They're the real monsters.

00:07:00.640 --> 00:07:03.450
In any case, we're back to normal.

00:07:04.170 --> 00:07:07.620
Now that it's quiet, let's 
get back to drinking.

00:07:08.550 --> 00:07:10.690
Cheers!

00:07:11.220 --> 00:07:13.560
You're staying?!

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:17.320
P-Perfect, this is my chance to escape.

00:07:17.930 --> 00:07:18.700
Excuse me.

00:07:20.850 --> 00:07:22.820
I have an appointment tonight.

00:07:23.390 --> 00:07:26.230
My name is Yagami.

00:07:39.580 --> 00:07:40.590
Yagami?

00:07:40.940 --> 00:07:41.880
Could it be?

00:07:42.630 --> 00:07:43.890
Could it be?

00:07:44.660 --> 00:07:47.610
Could you go tell Kyoshiro-san that

00:07:47.610 --> 00:07:50.370
the Madame has come to see him?

00:07:50.370 --> 00:07:52.390
The Madame is here!

00:07:52.960 --> 00:07:54.820
A-At the worst possible time...

00:07:55.270 --> 00:07:58.280
Booze! More booze!

00:07:55.270 --> 00:07:58.280
The monsters are still partying!

00:07:58.620 --> 00:07:59.980
I need to run away before I get caught up

00:07:59.980 --> 00:08:01.650
in this disaster waiting to happen!

00:08:01.830 --> 00:08:04.170
S-So sorry...

00:08:04.170 --> 00:08:06.660
The boss is out right now.

00:08:07.020 --> 00:08:09.660
I-I'll go get him!

00:08:09.910 --> 00:08:11.270
Don't worry, GIN.

00:08:11.270 --> 00:08:13.440
I already contacted the boss.

00:08:13.440 --> 00:08:16.230
Please have something to 
drink while you're waiting.

00:08:16.230 --> 00:08:17.500
Follow me.

00:08:16.230 --> 00:08:18.670
Y-You bastards!

00:08:18.880 --> 00:08:22.680
You thought you could run away 
after dragging us into this mess?

00:08:22.680 --> 00:08:26.180
All of us have to work together 
to entertain the Madame.

00:08:26.320 --> 00:08:29.560
What? Don't be stupid!

00:08:30.050 --> 00:08:32.080
Where's everybody else?

00:08:32.080 --> 00:08:34.060
When is the boss coming back?

00:08:34.080 --> 00:08:36.250
They're all out of action!

00:08:36.250 --> 00:08:38.570
Do you have any idea what will happen if we

00:08:38.570 --> 00:08:40.920
let the Madame join those drunken masters?

00:08:40.920 --> 00:08:43.590
It'd be like throwing a chair 
into a bunch of Jackie Chans!

00:08:43.590 --> 00:08:46.050
She'll be used for acrobatic moves, abused,

00:08:46.050 --> 00:08:47.830
then smashed against an enemy's head!

00:08:47.830 --> 00:08:49.410
I-It'll be okay!

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:50.300
Please follow me.

00:08:49.410 --> 00:08:51.300
Kyoshiro-san will come back!

00:08:51.300 --> 00:08:53.840
Until then, we'll have 
to entertain the Madame!

00:08:55.210 --> 00:08:57.840
Y-Your table is right over there.

00:09:02.740 --> 00:09:07.510
Oh, GIN-sama. Where do you 
think you're going without us?

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:10.240
I asked for you first!

00:09:10.240 --> 00:09:12.280
Get your ass over here and pour me booze!

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:13.170
Yeah!

00:09:13.170 --> 00:09:16.570
We're customers today, so 
you should treat us better!

00:09:16.570 --> 00:09:17.720
We were too easy to spot!

00:09:17.720 --> 00:09:19.520
Like Jackie Chan's nose!

00:09:19.820 --> 00:09:22.150
S-Sorry, baby.

00:09:22.370 --> 00:09:25.500
I need to help this lady for a little bit.

00:09:25.870 --> 00:09:28.910
GURA and TAE will take good care of you.

00:09:29.110 --> 00:09:32.490
What's that?! You're too 
good to drink with me?!

00:09:32.490 --> 00:09:33.540
Now she's going Jackie Chan on us!

00:09:33.830 --> 00:09:36.630
You got balls to steal our men!

00:09:36.630 --> 00:09:38.620
Wait! Don't do anything to the Madame!

00:09:38.620 --> 00:09:41.540
Did you come here by yourself to pick up men?

00:09:41.540 --> 00:09:44.950
You're a real piece of work! Right, Tsu-ki?

00:09:44.950 --> 00:09:46.390
You're no better!

00:09:46.760 --> 00:09:48.510
Wait, you got poop on your hair.

00:09:48.710 --> 00:09:51.650
Is everything okay?

00:09:51.650 --> 00:09:54.730
Hey! Somebody stop these drunks!

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:56.330
Would you two stop that?

00:09:57.400 --> 00:09:58.730
Excuse us.

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:00.940
I'll pay for the cleaning,

00:10:00.940 --> 00:10:03.050
but for now, let's use this to wipe that off.

00:10:03.050 --> 00:10:04.610
You're drunk, too?!

00:10:04.790 --> 00:10:07.590
Oh, it's bigger than I thought...

00:10:07.590 --> 00:10:10.550
The fancy toilet paper from the 
Yagyu household can't handle it.

00:10:10.550 --> 00:10:13.290
Uh, you're wiping her face! Stop it!

00:10:13.490 --> 00:10:16.820
Oh, Kyu-chan! You shouldn't do that!

00:10:16.820 --> 00:10:20.280
Let the employees handle this.

00:10:20.280 --> 00:10:22.600
If it won't come off, you wet the paper,

00:10:23.060 --> 00:10:24.250
and scrub hard.

00:10:24.250 --> 00:10:24.920
Hey!

00:10:24.920 --> 00:10:26.670
Even our employees are piss drunk!

00:10:27.280 --> 00:10:28.460
Oh, it won't come off.

00:10:28.460 --> 00:10:29.990
It wasn't wet enough.

00:10:29.990 --> 00:10:30.930
Give it to me, boss lady.

00:10:33.930 --> 00:10:36.930
<b>Takamagahara</b>

00:10:39.720 --> 00:10:42.090
I had too much Koronamin C.

00:10:42.090 --> 00:10:44.820
That's why kids are only 
supposed to have one a day.

00:10:45.330 --> 00:10:47.930
I see that my friends inconvenienced you.

00:10:47.930 --> 00:10:51.320
It's on me, so drink away.

00:10:53.570 --> 00:10:56.410
After all that rude behavior,

00:10:56.410 --> 00:10:59.250
it's turned into a Jackie Chan carnival?!

00:10:59.470 --> 00:11:00.470
What are we going to do?!

00:11:00.470 --> 00:11:03.290
We won't be able to look after the Madame!

00:11:03.710 --> 00:11:05.770
She's already about to snap!

00:11:05.770 --> 00:11:09.590
I can't blame her, considering 
the abuse she's had to endure!

00:11:09.910 --> 00:11:14.150
If anything else goes wrong, 
we'll be in big trouble!

00:11:14.150 --> 00:11:16.350
Anyway, let's try to 
improve the Madame's mood!

00:11:17.700 --> 00:11:21.770
Uh, Yagami-san? What are you drinking there?

00:11:21.770 --> 00:11:22.860
Oolong Highball.

00:11:22.860 --> 00:11:25.870
Oh, that's good. I love those.

00:11:25.870 --> 00:11:29.170
It doesn't leave much of an 
aftertaste. Right, TOSHI?

00:11:29.170 --> 00:11:32.940
Huh? Yeah, I'm pretty 
high on that Oolong pig.

00:11:32.940 --> 00:11:39.370
Hell, Yamcha's little buddy is my 
favorite character in Dragonball...

00:11:40.310 --> 00:11:42.790
That's Puar!

00:11:46.700 --> 00:11:49.050
Yeah. Right. That's Puar!

00:11:49.290 --> 00:11:51.910
Oh, speaking of Dragonball, Yagami-san.

00:11:51.910 --> 00:11:53.700
Who's your favorite character?

00:11:53.700 --> 00:11:54.500
Let me guess.

00:11:54.500 --> 00:11:57.430
I'm pretty good at Dragonball 
character fortune telling.

00:11:58.050 --> 00:12:00.110
Let's see, you're a Tien...

00:12:00.110 --> 00:12:02.190
No, you might actually be a Vegeta.

00:12:03.010 --> 00:12:05.480
The king of King Castle!

00:12:08.990 --> 00:12:13.610
Right. You have unique taste. 
The king of King Castle.

00:12:13.930 --> 00:12:15.370
That's a rare choice.

00:12:15.890 --> 00:12:17.660
So Yagami-san, are you a...

00:12:18.320 --> 00:12:20.950
It's King Furry!

00:12:22.460 --> 00:12:24.600
Yeah, that guy looked like a dog.

00:12:24.600 --> 00:12:26.970
Come to think of it, there were 
a bunch of animal characters

00:12:26.970 --> 00:12:28.750
in the beginning, but it 
turned into a humanoid

00:12:28.750 --> 00:12:30.920
fest like a certain other manga...

00:12:31.730 --> 00:12:34.220
Put yourself in Toriyama's shoes!

00:12:35.140 --> 00:12:38.680
Yeah, Toriyama had a lot to...

00:12:39.850 --> 00:12:41.060
Pororoca!

00:12:43.170 --> 00:12:44.410
Uh, hold on.

00:12:44.410 --> 00:12:48.010
Is it me or were those girls 
beating us up for the hell of it?

00:12:48.010 --> 00:12:50.260
That last one had nothing 
to do with Dragonball.

00:12:50.260 --> 00:12:52.930
Her timing would have been 
perfect for a quiz show.

00:12:52.930 --> 00:12:54.570
And I've been hit an extra time...

00:12:55.050 --> 00:12:56.520
Sorry!

00:12:56.520 --> 00:12:59.590
The correct answer was the Candiru,

00:12:59.590 --> 00:13:02.790
the carnivorous catfish that 
lives in the Amazon region!

00:13:04.370 --> 00:13:06.630
Hey! What's wrong with those drunks?!

00:13:06.630 --> 00:13:09.560
Do they have to smack us in the 
head every time they talk?!

00:13:09.560 --> 00:13:11.800
They aren't giving us a chance 
to talk to the Madame!

00:13:11.800 --> 00:13:15.260
And why are we talking about 
Dragonball with a woman?

00:13:15.260 --> 00:13:18.880
I was trying to help you recover 
from that Oolong tea crap!

00:13:18.880 --> 00:13:20.710
What the hell is Dragonball fortune telling?!

00:13:20.710 --> 00:13:23.060
You could have just asked what her type was!

00:13:23.440 --> 00:13:24.620
King of King Castle!

00:13:24.620 --> 00:13:25.340
Colonel Silver!

00:13:25.340 --> 00:13:26.050
Bardock!

00:13:26.050 --> 00:13:27.920
The female in Bardock's crew!

00:13:27.920 --> 00:13:29.740
The joke with a power level of 
five that's beaten up by Raditz!

00:13:29.750 --> 00:13:30.360
Pororoca!

00:13:30.360 --> 00:13:30.940
Vegeta.

00:13:35.110 --> 00:13:38.350
Hey, we used Dragonball to get them 
to tell us what their type is!

00:13:38.350 --> 00:13:40.250
And they all have weird taste!

00:13:40.250 --> 00:13:42.820
One of them keeps saying Pororoca!

00:13:42.820 --> 00:13:46.000
Wasn't there an extra answer?

00:13:49.420 --> 00:13:51.780
She answered!

00:13:52.490 --> 00:13:54.960
Hey! The Madame is actually participating!

00:13:54.960 --> 00:13:56.890
Which one?! Which one did she like?!

00:13:56.890 --> 00:13:58.760
I-It was probably Vegeta!

00:13:58.960 --> 00:14:01.590
Oh, you like Vegeta?

00:14:01.590 --> 00:14:04.140
A lot of women like Vegeta.

00:14:04.280 --> 00:14:06.720
It's the whole falling for the bad boy

00:14:06.720 --> 00:14:09.570
after seeing him help a 
puppy out of the rain.

00:14:09.570 --> 00:14:13.060
Wait! The girls are starting 
a discussion about Vegeta!

00:14:13.060 --> 00:14:16.700
A lot of stupid women 
fall for those bad boys.

00:14:16.700 --> 00:14:19.040
In most cases, they get knocked up, married,

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:21.030
and divorced in one breath.

00:14:21.130 --> 00:14:24.300
That relationship only worked 
because Bulma was rich.

00:14:24.300 --> 00:14:28.270
Being a Super Saiyan doesn't mean 
much if you don't have a job.

00:14:28.270 --> 00:14:30.230
And you can't say that he's gentle inside

00:14:30.230 --> 00:14:32.720
when he only ever cried because 
of his pride as a Saiyan

00:14:32.720 --> 00:14:34.330
or because he was scared of Frieza.

00:14:34.330 --> 00:14:37.210
That man only cares about himself.

00:14:37.210 --> 00:14:38.370
Yeah, yeah.

00:14:38.370 --> 00:14:40.360
Vegeta is getting beat down!

00:14:40.360 --> 00:14:42.930
This is worse than when he got 
his ass handed to him by Frieza!

00:14:43.520 --> 00:14:47.640
As far as loners go, Piccolo is much better.

00:14:47.640 --> 00:14:51.770
He cried before Gohan, and 
he takes good care of kids.

00:14:51.770 --> 00:14:53.810
But those shoulder pads would get in the way.

00:14:53.810 --> 00:14:55.620
You can't latch onto his arm.

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:56.930
Vegeta has the same problem!

00:14:56.930 --> 00:14:59.920
Vegeta wore normal clothes sometimes, 
though they looked terrible.

00:14:59.920 --> 00:15:02.700
Stop it! You're making the Madame, 
the Vegeta fan, look bad!

00:15:02.700 --> 00:15:06.650
With that widow's peak, it 
wouldn't matter what he wore.

00:15:06.650 --> 00:15:09.780
He probably just threw on 
whatever Bulma bought for him.

00:15:09.780 --> 00:15:11.690
Oh.

00:15:11.690 --> 00:15:16.710
But I'm guessing he bought 
the shirt that said BADMAN.

00:15:16.980 --> 00:15:18.850
Yeah, out of the question.

00:15:18.850 --> 00:15:20.360
Vegeta's out of the question.

00:15:20.360 --> 00:15:21.400
Stop!

00:15:21.400 --> 00:15:24.720
And how much time have you 
people spent on Dragonball?!

00:15:25.430 --> 00:15:28.000
But Bulma looked happier 
when she was with him,

00:15:28.000 --> 00:15:30.940
compared to when she was with Yamcha.

00:15:31.290 --> 00:15:33.440
Once Trunks was born, he settled down

00:15:33.440 --> 00:15:35.020
and became a good father.

00:15:35.020 --> 00:15:36.590
He forced his way into the conversation!

00:15:36.590 --> 00:15:38.780
He dove right in, like a widow's peak!

00:15:39.050 --> 00:15:41.380
Oh, Yagami-san. Your glass is empty.

00:15:41.380 --> 00:15:42.780
Another Oolong Highball?

00:15:42.780 --> 00:15:43.780
Yes.

00:15:43.780 --> 00:15:45.440
Hey, TOSHI!

00:15:45.440 --> 00:15:47.290
Bring a Oolong Highball!

00:15:49.200 --> 00:15:51.830
Why are you recreating one 
of Vegeta's famous scenes?!

00:15:51.830 --> 00:15:55.960
That's the famous farewell with Trunks!

00:15:56.810 --> 00:15:57.690
Imo shochu!

00:15:57.690 --> 00:15:58.520
Cassis Orange!

00:15:58.520 --> 00:15:59.100
Japanese sake!

00:15:59.100 --> 00:15:59.870
With soda!

00:15:59.870 --> 00:16:00.650
Whiskey!

00:16:00.650 --> 00:16:01.410
Pororoca!

00:16:01.410 --> 00:16:03.530
The famous scene had no effect!

00:16:03.530 --> 00:16:06.220
Vegeta can't do anything in this world!

00:16:08.770 --> 00:16:10.710
Heh, dirty fireworks.

00:16:10.710 --> 00:16:12.120
She joined in!

00:16:12.120 --> 00:16:14.260
The Madame is playing Vegeta!

00:16:14.260 --> 00:16:15.870
She's a pretty fun person!

00:16:15.870 --> 00:16:17.000
Hang in there!

00:16:17.000 --> 00:16:20.240
The Madame's heart is slowly opening!

00:16:20.640 --> 00:16:23.690
But those drunks are still a problem.

00:16:23.690 --> 00:16:25.190
We need to deal with them before

00:16:25.190 --> 00:16:28.020
we can get anywhere with 
the Madame, Kakarot...

00:16:28.020 --> 00:16:29.720
Uh, who are you calling Kakarot?

00:16:31.260 --> 00:16:33.620
Oh, ladies?

00:16:34.210 --> 00:16:36.130
What is this party for?

00:16:36.860 --> 00:16:39.430
A little get-together for models?

00:16:39.430 --> 00:16:41.670
S-SOUGO-san!

00:16:41.670 --> 00:16:45.230
Please! You're such a sweet talker!

00:16:45.230 --> 00:16:48.000
This is just a supermodel powwow!

00:16:48.000 --> 00:16:50.040
Oh, forgive me.

00:16:50.040 --> 00:16:54.400
You're all so beautiful that I got confused.

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:56.480
H-He sidestepped them?

00:16:57.080 --> 00:16:59.120
Hey, what are you guys doing?

00:16:59.120 --> 00:17:00.870
Bring the goods.

00:17:01.280 --> 00:17:01.990
The goods?

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:05.030
The champagne tower that's actually

00:17:06.190 --> 00:17:08.490
filled with tequila!

00:17:08.900 --> 00:17:11.000
Tequila tower?!

00:17:16.910 --> 00:17:18.000
I see!

00:17:18.000 --> 00:17:21.380
He's going to subdue them 
by getting them drunk!

00:17:22.060 --> 00:17:23.380
Are you ready?

00:17:23.490 --> 00:17:26.390
Let's party!

00:17:26.550 --> 00:17:28.290
SOUGO-san...

00:17:28.290 --> 00:17:31.390
He's so evil that he doesn't 
give a damn about abusing women.

00:17:31.970 --> 00:17:33.850
He's a prodigy host!

00:17:41.270 --> 00:17:43.400
You guys were the ones subdued?!

00:17:43.990 --> 00:17:46.410
I've never had Dom Perignon before,

00:17:46.410 --> 00:17:48.310
but it's almost like drinking water.

00:17:48.310 --> 00:17:51.400
I need more booze! Bring the whole keg!

00:17:51.400 --> 00:17:53.590
The tequila isn't doing 
anything to the women!

00:17:53.590 --> 00:17:55.220
They're too strong!

00:17:55.220 --> 00:17:57.370
Hey, Yagami-san! I know you want some more!

00:17:57.950 --> 00:18:00.830
No, I've had enough...

00:18:00.830 --> 00:18:02.340
Had enough?!

00:18:02.340 --> 00:18:04.630
How did she empty all of 
those glasses so fast?!

00:18:05.190 --> 00:18:09.590
I've had quite a bit to drink, 
so I will be leaving now.

00:18:10.420 --> 00:18:13.030
Er, hold on!

00:18:13.440 --> 00:18:16.160
I had a wonderful time tonight.

00:18:16.160 --> 00:18:18.650
Please let Kyoshiro-san know.

00:18:18.650 --> 00:18:21.240
Hold on! Why are you leaving?!

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:22.570
Aren't you...

00:18:23.540 --> 00:18:28.780
I would not dare to see Kyoshiro-san 
when my face is so flushed.

00:18:29.460 --> 00:18:31.750
You don't want to see him?

00:18:32.700 --> 00:18:38.210
So you didn't come back because 
you didn't like the bar?

00:18:39.060 --> 00:18:40.350
You came to see Kyoshiro-san?

00:18:41.720 --> 00:18:45.520
So you have heard the stories.

00:18:46.180 --> 00:18:52.150
Unfortunately, I am no goddess of fortune,

00:18:52.150 --> 00:18:57.250
nor am I a goddess of death.

00:18:58.330 --> 00:19:01.530
Nor do I have the ability 
to ruin an entire town.

00:19:01.530 --> 00:19:04.820
My obsession with the power of money left me

00:19:04.820 --> 00:19:06.690
with no friends, no home.

00:19:07.220 --> 00:19:10.090
I never visited a bar twice

00:19:10.090 --> 00:19:13.550
because I didn't want people 
tiptoeing around me.

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:17.930
But at some point, I became famous around Edo

00:19:17.930 --> 00:19:20.520
and lost my only refuge.

00:19:21.640 --> 00:19:24.900
That was when I met Kyoshiro-sama.

00:19:25.800 --> 00:19:27.110
His smile was different

00:19:27.110 --> 00:19:30.380
from the false ones that always greeted me.

00:19:30.890 --> 00:19:35.180
His smile was for everyone, not just me.

00:19:35.540 --> 00:19:41.550
I assume that was because 
he loved his job as a host.

00:19:42.010 --> 00:19:46.150
His smile was very special to me.

00:19:46.880 --> 00:19:50.150
I returned to see that smile again.

00:19:50.850 --> 00:19:55.840
You must have come to 
replace the hosts who quit.

00:19:56.970 --> 00:19:59.330
I truly apologize.

00:20:00.160 --> 00:20:01.370
Do not worry.

00:20:01.960 --> 00:20:03.710
The goddess of death

00:20:03.710 --> 00:20:06.670
will never walk the night streets again.

00:20:07.010 --> 00:20:10.000
But it was very fun.

00:20:10.520 --> 00:20:12.740
I didn't get to see Kyoshiro-san,

00:20:12.740 --> 00:20:14.760
but I saw many smiles that

00:20:14.760 --> 00:20:16.680
would turn away any goddess of death.

00:20:27.150 --> 00:20:29.990
Ya-Yagami-san...

00:20:39.880 --> 00:20:43.620
Ma'am, do you have any plans tonight?

00:20:48.790 --> 00:20:52.250
If not, why not drop by Takamagahara,

00:20:52.250 --> 00:20:55.890
the refuge for angels, to rest your wings?

00:20:57.300 --> 00:21:00.300
I'm sorry to say that my wings are black,

00:21:00.300 --> 00:21:03.140
as they only cause sorrow.

00:21:03.380 --> 00:21:06.300
Oh, you sound like an angel of death.

00:21:06.800 --> 00:21:12.400
However, I believe that particular 
goddess has already left.

00:21:12.930 --> 00:21:16.380
I've heard that Madame Yagami first appears

00:21:16.380 --> 00:21:18.300
as a goddess of fortune,

00:21:18.300 --> 00:21:21.510
then as a goddess of death 
to bring misfortune.

00:21:22.640 --> 00:21:26.760
Then what happens when 
she visits a third time?

00:21:35.410 --> 00:21:37.430
Hey, we've been waiting for you.

00:21:37.880 --> 00:21:40.430
The drinks are on you this time.

00:21:40.760 --> 00:21:41.770
Drinking buddies!

00:21:41.770 --> 00:21:44.050
All lined up!

00:21:45.450 --> 00:21:47.940
Welcome to Takamagahara.

00:21:57.020 --> 00:21:59.560
Heh, dirty fireworks.

00:23:29.940 --> 00:23:42.120
<b>Next Episode</b>

00:23:30.530 --> 00:23:33.840
Jellybeans Vanguard Honda,

00:23:33.840 --> 00:23:37.750
is a Jump editor who's just 
gotten married when a

00:23:37.750 --> 00:23:40.130
new promising manga artist 
appears before him!

00:23:40.130 --> 00:23:40.970
Next time:

00:23:40.970 --> 00:23:44.930
Draw your life on the canvas we call manga.

00:23:42.160 --> 00:23:44.910
<b>Draw Your Life on the Canvas We Call Manga</b>

00:23:44.950 --> 00:23:54.920
<b>Jellybeans Vanguard Honda 
has been assigned to Gintaman</b>

00:23:44.950 --> 00:23:54.920
<b>To escape the despair which plagues him,
he must land the new artist a regular series!!</b>
